**Fix.** Add SLT-PROD-14 to SLT-SETUP-05's dependency list (deps become SLT-SETUP-02, SLT-PROD-16, SLT-PROD-14) and schedule both on D1 with SLT-PROD-14 strictly before SLT-SETUP-05.

