# Dogfood Report: {APP_NAME}

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Date** | {DATE} |
| **App URL** | {URL} |
| **Session** | {SESSION_NAME} |
| **Scope** | {SCOPE} |

## Summary

| Severity | Count |
