reference/SLT-REF-06-flexible-renewal-sync-segment-partition-math-meta-keys-first.md:133:`pushBoundaryForward()` converts the boundary to site TZ, applies `arraysubs_increment_renewal_sync_boundary()`, converts back to UTC (`SegmentPlan.php:388-403`). If it returns `''` the mode **falls back to `full`** rather than risking a wrong date (`Hooks.php:401-407`).
