+- WP-CLI meta readback for `12099`: enabled `yes`, active flags `no/yes/yes`, positional boundaries `1/3`.
+- WP-CLI `SegmentPlan::getConfig(12102)` returned `actives => [3]` and an empty `boundaries` array.
